    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu connais Airmure, le Pokémon Armoiseau ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200063006F006E006E0061006900730020004100690072006D007500720065002C0020006C006500200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002000410072006D006F006900730065006100750020003F001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ses plumes sont si légères et aiguisées qu’on s’en\nsert depuis toujours pour fabriquer des lames.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 102
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je voudrais une plume d’Airmure pour\nen faire cadeau à un grand chef cuisinier.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 676,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu participes au Royale Z-A, non ? J’aimerais\nque tu me trouves une plume d’Airmure.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attention, car les Airmure vivent dans la zone\nsauvage nº 17, qui regorge de nombreux autres<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nPokémon très dangereux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1024,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 125
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Heureusement, tu n’as pas l’air d’avoir froid\naux yeux. Alors, merci d’avance !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 84
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1444,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trouve-moi une plume d’Airmure dans\nla zone sauvage nº 17, s’il te plaît !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1456,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a une plume d’Airmure au sol !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C002000790020006100200075006E006500200070006C0075006D0065002000642019004100690072006D00750072006500200061007500200073006F006C002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’étaient des serres d’Airmure ! Dommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E90074006100690065006E007400200064006500730020007300650072007200650073002000642019004100690072006D0075007200650020002100200044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoi que c’était, ça a été brûlé\npar un Mélancolux. Dommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F0069002000710075006500200063201900E90074006100690074002C002000E7006100200061002000E9007400E900200062007200FB006C00E9000A00700061007200200075006E0020004D00E9006C0061006E0063006F006C00750078002E00200044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était un fragment de clé de Trousselin.\nDommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E9007400610069007400200075006E00200066007200610067006D0065006E007400200064006500200063006C00E9002000640065002000540072006F0075007300730065006C0069006E002E000A0044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était une boule de poils d’Excavarenne.\nDommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E9007400610069007400200075006E006500200062006F0075006C006500200064006500200070006F0069006C007300200064201900450078006300610076006100720065006E006E0065002E000A0044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était un piquant de Marisson. Dommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E9007400610069007400200075006E002000700069007100750061006E00740020006400650020004D00610072006900730073006F006E002E00200044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était des poils de crinière d’un Némélios\nfemelle. Dommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900E90074006100690074002000640065007300200070006F0069006C00730020006400650020006300720069006E006900E8007200650020006420190075006E0020004E00E9006D00E9006C0069006F0073000A00660065006D0065006C006C0065002E00200044006F006D006D006100670065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 63
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’était des poils de crinière d’un Némélios\nmâle. Dommage !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
